<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur uwu Uyahuda aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uyah</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur uwu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="mt2">aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uyahuda</para>
  <para style="ip">Uyahuda unga atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Abɔɔ akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ra amɛk aki 65-67 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu. Unga atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ agbiite ato abika adɔsa ri itsi abika amesuwe imesi igbɛrangwĩ, abirabɛ aka anyanga atsimbɔ ugɛɛ umbɔ awu abika adɔsa. Ru ungwɛ̃rhũ ubvur uwurɛ, uwuruwi uku uwe ru nyaka abinkɛ aka awe ru 2 Ubitru, Uyahuda afituwe abika avarha umgbɔ ugɛ umbɔ, &lt;&lt;akaa idzidzɛrhayɛ Unum aka adzowe abika adɔsa kishoo idikunga unying.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uyahuda <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ifɛrhɛ, imesa, nu itsitsĩm iyi abika amesuwe imesi igbɛrangwĩ <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uyisa ukpuku ububima <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ifɛn-Num iyiki imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Ubvur udzeku Uyahuda, ugãrhũ Uyesu Ukiristo, ungwɛ̃mbɔ Uyaku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Izĩ ra abirabɛ umbɔ aka ayisa, abirabɛ Unum Utɛ aka abema, abirabɛ Uyesu Ukiristo aka aden.<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Uneke Unum ama adzaa umbi atorh, ididɔɔr nu ibibema irhɛirhɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Arhim nu itsitsĩm abika <optbreak/> asheru Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Umbi aze awɛrhɛ, nggayɛ umum ĩbeemum itsɛnga umbi arherhe ififɔrh ha umɛn iki inggasha, bɔr umum inyã awu ufang umum itsɛng ifituwa umbi ru umbi akaa idzidzɛrhayɛ Unum aka adzowe abika adɔsa kishoo idikunga unying. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Ubinkutsu, aner abɔɔ, abirabɛ itsitsĩm iki itsɛng ra atsimbɔ ishaisha, aka aghɔ̃rhã atsĩwãmbɔ ru umbi. Umbɔ ashimbɔ ru Unum, abika adzipu imimutu Unummɛn ngge iwe udĩ ikorhe itser iki itãrhã na atsɛyi Uyesu Ukiristo, unga iki iyikanga aka awu Uteiyamɛn nu Uteijeemɛn.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Umum ihwɛng umbi aka ahwɛngmbi akɛrɛ ha kishoo, umum ibee iyituwa umbi ĩgɛ Uteijee aka afɔrhe anernga adzek ra abĩ Umasar, na abvui atsĩme abirabɛ aka ashimbɔ ri imangmang ra anernga hã. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Àka ayita ikɛi ípfu itser-Num iyɔɔ iki isi idɛ̃ɛ̃ngge ra anang ijeengge, na abɔrukumbɔ anang iseimbɔ. Uteijee afɔme ngge ru uzĩ, abow ngge nggu inyãwã iyi ugbagbaa adzɛu unum ukpuku uzharha arherha ha. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Ru nyaka ha, Usɔdɔm nu Ugomora nu iteu iyiki ikhapa nggu ngge, adzowe atsimbɔ ru kishoo itser iyiki itoma-dak nu nggaa ikponi iyor iyiki ibewe. Umbɔ awu ru nyaku utsar abirabɛ aka ahwa ayetnum urha ukpu ugbagbaa.<verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Iwe rimi hã ikɛi ra abirabɛ aka aghɔ̃rhã atsĩwã ru umbi, irheyirhɔ idarh umbɔ, atsuke ayormbɔ ishĩ, akpɛ̃mbɔ idɔsa abi ijee, na ayɛɛi abi ikpikpoi afã. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Bɔr uko Umika'irhu unggbaashi Ípfu itser-Num, unga asi ikeramɛn anyatunga Undenggũ use arhenunga unga, bɔr agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uteijee atsɛrha ungo!&gt;&gt; Akɛrɛ akorhe ri ivangyɛ ngge iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ uning nggu Undenggũ ru ukom iyor Umusa. <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Bɔr aner abɛrɛ aka aghɔ̃rhã atsĩwã ru umbi, arhena kishoo ubinkpi umbɔ aka asi ihwɛngmbɔ, nu abinkɛ umbɔ aka ahwɛng awe ri iyor, ru nyaki ijuɛyɛ iki ishingge ra amɛn, ikpũ abin hã ikũna umbɔ izĩ itsitsĩme.<verse eid="JUD 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Atorhmbɔ! Adɔsu utsĩndĩ Ukayinu. Azang abee ighigha azĩ agbambɔ ri igbairha ikpũ iyi Ubarha'am. Umbɔ atsim ri ikpũ iyi isoyamɛn Ukora.<verse eid="JUD 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Aner abɛrɛ adakuwe ikikɔngmbi iyi irhowa ibibemambi, aghesha abin nggu umbi ashimbɔ ra atsa, ashimbɔ ri iwei. Imɛ̃ngge umbɔ adzɛu anera bɔr umbɔ afukuwe atsimbɔ ukpekũ. Awu ru nyaki irhifin, ugba iki ikɛn, bɔr inai ishingge ru ukpɔ. Awu ru nyaka acuciiakɛ aka ashike ri ikpũrhã ri ivang iki igbɛr, na abvurhuwe ake akpe undzumunga. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Umbɔ awu ru nyaki ibɔrh amɛ̃ ukau ukpuku ugɔng iki itengasha, umbɔ akũwe abin atsak akirakɛ aka akpɛta ru nyaku ufuu. Umbɔ awu ru nyaki ídzɛɛr iyiriyɛ iki iyarhe izĩ itsĩ ru uzĩ ukufĩrhã uku ugbagbaa.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Uenɔk awe ru undankpu utɔɔva udzur ru Uadamu, unga asɔm Arherhu-Num ri itsi anera abɛrɛ agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unyã! Uteijee uwɔɔ abarɔ nggu asarkasar ípfu itser-Numnga anaka agɔnga irhɛirhɛ, <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>aba itsu izharha arherhe ri itsi anera kishoo. Awuri idɛyiwe igbigba abirabɛ aka asi idɔsumbɔ Unum, ri kishoo umbɔ aka akorhe ru udĩ ida iwei Unum, nu kishoo irhɛm iki itsooyɛ abi arhim aka ashimbɔ ri iwei Unum aka arherhe ri itsinga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Aner abɛrɛ awu abika abvun arherhe, abee inyã uvau abɔɔ. Umbɔ aka isaka adɔsi ikpona iyiki ibewambɔ, umbɔ afĩrhã akpoi atsimbɔ na akũ irhɛm iyiki ize abee ikpo ighigha.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyisa ukpuku ububima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Bɔr umbi, aze awɛrhɛ, àka ayita abinkɛ abi itser Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo aka atiti irherhe. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Agɔr umbi agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ri imimashu upfung, abika ayuyɛɛi awuri ibambɔ. Umbɔ awuri idɔsi ikpona iyiki ibewambɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Aner abɛrɛ agashuwe umbi, abika adɔsi ikponi iyor na ashimbɔ ri Ipfu-Num.<verse eid="JUD 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Bɔr umbi, aze awɛrhɛ, àka aseng atoma ru asarkasar imangmangmbi na afɛn-Num ri ijee Ipfu Isarsatangge. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Àka akpɔm atsimbi ri ibibemu Unum, na adzɛu ibiba atorh Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo aka ikũna umbi atsĩ urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Àka agũ atorh abika acucang. <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>Àka atsũwe abɔɔ ru urha na afɔrhe umbɔ, àka agũ atorh abɔɔ nggu iwei, utsur umbi atammbi arhimmbɔ bɔr àka agũ ishĩ uko atorhambɔ, umbɔ aka adakuwe nggu itser arhim aki iyor.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ifɛn-Num iyiki ikpikpoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Ikpikpoi iwe nggu uwuruwi aka awe ru ijee iyiki ivina umbi ri igbaigba, na atsu umbi awe abika asheru uvau ra asu ikpikpoinga nu nggaa anggɔm. <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>Ikpikpoi nu nggaa imor, nu ijee izĩ ru Unum, unga awu Unum ikiyikanga Uwuku Ufɔrh umɛn, ri itsok Uyesu Ukiristo Uteijeemɛn, udzur ri imimunu upfung, uba utsĩ icɛrɛ nu ugbagbaa! Iwerimi.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
